-- Keeper HQ: the full AFL player list in the database, not just the players on G-Train lists.
-- Adds every AFL-listed player from lib/free-agent-players.json who isn't already there (matched by dfs_id), so a new
-- league can import or draft anyone. Existing rows (G-Train's 319 listed players) are untouched.
